bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[color=#ffe066]🎯 OBJECTIVE & RULES:[/color]
• 🔴 [color=#ff4c4c]TAGGERS[/color] must tag all runners to encase them in 3D ice cubes!
• 🟢 [color=#4fc3f7]RUNNERS[/color] must survive until time runs out, or touch frozen teammates to thaw them!

[color=#ffe066]🎒 ITEMS & POWER-UPS (Press [E] to use):[/color]
• ⚡ [b]Speed Boost[/b]: Move 1.3x faster for 6s
• 🛡️ [b]Shield[/b]: Blocks 1 freeze attempt
• 🔥 [b]Heater[/b]: Unfreezes yourself immediately
• 🍌 [b]Banana Trap[/b]: Drops a banana that slips players for 2.5s
• 🌀 [b]Black Hole Vortex[/b]: Gravitational field pulling nearby players

[color=#ffe066]🎮 3D CONTROLS:[/color]
• Mouse: Orbit Camera
• WASD: Camera-Relative Movement
• Spacebar: Jump
• E Key: Use Single Collected Item"

